{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Motivation\n\nThe Projects page can only reproduce the views saved on GitHub. Slices like \"what is assigned to me and not done\" or \"swimlanes per assignee\" should be definable locally — without adding views to the GitHub project (and without write access to it).\n\n## Spec\n\n1. **`projects-view \"<name>\" { … }`** — a top-level node, repeatable, one per local view. Children:\n   - `layout \"board\" | \"table\" | \"roadmap\"` (default `board`)\n   - `filter \"<expression>\"` — the saved-view syntax evaluated locally (`status:Todo -label:bug assignee:@me is:issue no:iteration`, …; what `domain/filter.rs` supports)\n   - `columns \"<field>\"` — the single-select field whose options become the board columns (default `Status`)\n   - `group-by \"<field>\"` — swimlanes (board) / group rows (table)\n   - `sort \"<field>\" \"asc\" | \"desc\"` (repeatable)\n   - `fields \"Title\" \"Status\" \"Assignees\" …` — table columns\n   - `board \"<title>\"` or `board <number>` — apply to one linked project only (absent: every board)\n2. **Cycling** — local views follow GitHub's saved views in the `v` / `V` cycle; the header reads `View: <name> (local)`. `projects-view \"Mine\" default=#true { … }` shows that view first.\n3. **Merge** — a same-named view in the user config / `.vig.kdl` replaces, others are appended. A field name that the board does not have is not a startup error: the status bar notes `⚠ view \"Mine\": no field \"Foo\"` and that setting is ignored for the board.\n4. **Docs / demo** — Config Reference (en / ja, CI-verified examples), the `views-projects` guide chapter, README, a comment in `assets/default.kdl`, the Projects demo tape (local views need no fixture re-recording — no API involved).\n\nA throw-away filter prompt (`f` to type an expression on the spot) is a separate issue if wanted.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-09T09:18:26Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":182,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Projects: local views from the config (`projects-view` — filter / group-by / sort / layout)"}
